{#- The Menu (docs/features/navigation README §4.12 / D21, MENU-01): the page's one `<nav id="site-menu">`, rendered from
    NavigationRegistry for the viewer by MenuBuilder (nav_menu()) - rows the viewer may not use are not rendered (never
    locked, D13), counts from what the page already loads, so the Menu costs no statement of its own.
    surface: 'slot' (default) = the docked-column slot of every page (_menu_slot.html.twig): DOM in docked-column order,
    phone-only parts `menu-only-phone`, dock-only parts `menu-only-dock`; the phone panel (MENU-02b) moves the group
    nodes into phone order by data-order-phone (never CSS order, decision 29). 'page' = the `menu` page: phone rows only,
    in phone order.
    Moderators and admins get their entries of the page search as `<script type="application/json"
    id="nav-search-private">`, the nav's first child (MENU-03; assets/navigation/nav_search.js reads it).
    Chrome markup rules (implementation plan §3.2): no h1, no form, no .alert/.card-body/.nav-*; group headings are
    `p[role=heading][aria-level=2]`; every link and button carries data-nav="menu/<group>/<id>". -#}
{%- set menu = nav_menu(surface ?? 'slot') -%}
<nav id="site-menu" aria-label="{{ 'nav.menu.title'|trans }}" class="site-menu" data-surface="{{ menu.surface }}"
    {%- if not menu.viewer.isGuest() %} data-controller="menu-counts" data-menu-counts-url-value="{{ path('menu_counts') }}" data-menu-counts-player-value="{{ menu.viewer.playerId() }}"{% endif %}>
    {#- The page search's moderator / admin entries, for those viewers only - never in the public nav-search.json (MENU-03) -#}
    {%- set search_private = nav_search_private() -%}
    {%- if search_private is not null -%}<script type="application/json" id="nav-search-private">{{ search_private|raw }}</script>{%- endif -%}
    {#- The launch's 30-day pointer line (LAUNCH-03): accounts older than the launch, until dismissed - nothing while
        NavigationLaunch::DATE is null, never for guests. Not a group: the phone panel's reordering never moves it -#}
    {{- include('navigation/_launch_pointer.html.twig', {variant: 'menu'}, with_context = false) -}}
    {%- for group in menu.groups -%}
        {{- include('navigation/_menu_group.html.twig', {group: group, viewer: menu.viewer, surface: menu.surface}, with_context = false) -}}
    {%- endfor -%}
</nav>
